@title Schematic: EMC cable card and the shield fix (1366x768)
@area Schematic
@sizes 1366x768
# Pick a wire of the motor cable with EMC net classes on: the panel shows the cable (cores, shield ends, twist), the EMC check's findings about it and the fixes; Apply is one undo step.
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text open emc example
wait 8
key Enter
wait 30
key PageDown
wait 8
key PageDown
wait 12
key ctrl+k
wait 6
text emc net classes
wait 8
key Enter
wait 20
click 166 420
wait 12
expect "Cable =A1+CAB-W2"
expect "Indicative: a design aid, not a test result."
expect "holds or it does not"
shot cable-card
check_layout
scroll 1180 400 2000
wait 8
click_text "Apply: Use a shielded cable." #1
wait 15
expect "Shield: end A"
shot cable-card-after-shield
check_layout
# The second fix sets both shield ends all round: the finding goes.
scroll 1180 400 2000
wait 8
click_text "Apply: Bond both shield ends" #1
wait 15
scroll 1180 400 -2000
wait 8
expect "end A bonded all round"
shot cable-card-after-ends
check_layout
scroll 1180 400 2000
wait 8
expect "No finding about this cable"
shot cable-card-no-finding
check_layout
